The effect of a systematic change in surface roughness skewness on turbulence and drag
Karen A. Flack a,*, Michael P. Schultz b, Ralph J. Volino a
a Department of Mechanical Engineering, United States Naval Academy, 590 Holloway Rd, Annapolis, MD 21402 USA
